OL,3,GNEWSASwinney to cut number of health
OL,4,Aboards in efficiency drive
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans to cut the number of health
OL,7,Fboards could result in just two bodies
OL,8,Frunning local NHS services on mainland
OL,9,FScotland.
OL,11,FDetails of proposed changes to the
OL,12,Fcurrent 14-board model are to be set
OL,13,Fout by First Minister John Swinney in
OL,14,Fhis programme for government at
OL,15,FHolyrood later.
OL,17,FIt is expected to major on public
OL,18,Fservice reform aimed at saving money
OL,19,Fand improving efficiency by cutting
OL,20,Flayers of management.
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
